{"ref":"BDB, חֲסִידָה","hw":"חֲסִידָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲסִידָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. stork (</strong>so called as kind and affectionate to its young<strong>)</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.19\">Lv 11:19</a> = <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.18\">Dt 14:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:17\" href=\"/Psalms.104.17\">ψ 104:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.7\">Je 8:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 5:9\" href=\"/Zechariah.5.9\">Zc 5:9</a>; cf. Lat. <em>pietaticultrix</em>.","next":"BDB, חֲסַדְיָה","prev":"BDB, חָסִיד"}